# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Dream Halls offers its discard alternative cost for every spell, not only the first.
# Forcing: No lands; each creature can only be cast by discarding a card that shares its color.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no permanents or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Card roles:
#   Dream Halls — grants the alternative cost.
#   Wind Drake and Raging Goblin — the first and second creature cast.
#   Opt and Shock — discards sharing blue and red respectively.
# Protocol path: alternative-cost cast offer, discard cost selection, resolution, offer recomputation.

[metadata]
Name:Dream Halls Second Creature
Goal:Survive
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Cast Wind Drake by discarding Opt, then cast Raging Goblin by discarding Shock.

